DESCRIPTION=CI: scripts/check_version_entries_semver_dev_unique.sh enforces unique (MAJOR, STANDARD, RELEASE, DEV_VERSION) across version/entries (implicit DEV_VERSION=0 when omitted). Documented in docs/versioning.md, version/*/ABOUT.txt, .cursor/rules/versioning.mdc, .coderabbit.yaml.
